@startuml
actor Student
participant BookingService
database BookingRepository

Student -> BookingService: bookRoom(studentId, roomId, startTime, endTime)

BookingService -> BookingService: validateFutureStart(startTime)
BookingService -> BookingService: validateDuration(startTime, endTime)
BookingService -> BookingRepository: isRoomBlocked(roomId)
BookingRepository --> BookingService: blockedStatus
BookingService -> BookingRepository: hasOverlappingActiveBooking(roomId, startTime, endTime)
BookingRepository --> BookingService: overlapStatus

alt all validations passed
    BookingService -> BookingRepository: createBooking(studentId, roomId, startTime, endTime)
    BookingRepository --> BookingService: bookingCreated
    BookingService --> Student: bookingConfirmation
else invalid start time or duration
    BookingService --> Student: bookingRejected(R1)
else room blocked
    BookingService --> Student: bookingRejected(R3)
else overlapping active booking
    BookingService --> Student: bookingRejected(R2)
end

note right of BookingService
R1: startTime is in the future and
duration is > 0 and <= 2 hours.

R2: Active bookings for the same
room must not overlap.

R3: A blocked room cannot accept
a new booking.

R4: Confirmation is returned only
after successful creation.

Assumption: bookings whose time
boundaries only touch do not overlap.
end note

@enduml